            },
            "reviewBody": "The question is \"how big is a scoop?\" I added 2 huge scoops and less milk because I like a nice and thick chocolate shake. It was just right with a dollop of whipped cream on top. Yummy! I might add some Peppermint drops next time for a minty version.",
